      "id": "CVE-2026-117511",
      "publishedDate": "2026-10-27T16:00:16.451Z",
      "lastModifiedDate": "2026-10-27T16:00:16.451Z",
      "description": "A vulnerability has been found in desmondmorris node-tesseract up to 0.2.7. Affected by this issue is the function process of the file lib/tesseract.js of the component Command Builder. Such manipulation of the argument image leads to os command injection. The attack can be executed remotely. The exploit has been disclosed to the public and may be used. The project was informed of the problem early through an issue report but has not responded yet.",
